{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":202,"count":33,"items":[{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-25\",\"好像\",\"好像\",\"好像\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他今天怎麼了？好像不太高興。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-25","sourceFront":"好像","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他在 KTV 唱歌的樣子，好像歌星一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-22","sourceFront":"樣子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個孩子受了傷，好像快死了，媽媽請醫生快點兒救救他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-19","sourceFront":"救","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小王手裡提著那麼多東西，好像很重，我們過去幫他提一些吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-01","sourceFront":"提","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-22","sourceFront":"情侶裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-23","sourceFront":"情侶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這裡的風景美極了，好像人間天堂一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-13","sourceFront":"人間","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位畫家的作品十分生動，畫裡的人物好像真的能從畫裡走出來一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-11","sourceFront":"生動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"弟弟：爺爺怎麼常把我和你的名字搞錯？ 哥哥：爺爺年紀太大了，腦子不清楚，好像不認得我們了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-29","sourceFront":"認得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L02-1-32\",\"有用\",\"有用\",\"有用\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這種藥很有用，吃了以後頭就不疼了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-32","sourceFront":"有用","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"對大多數人來說，沒有用的垃圾是廢物，有用的垃圾是資源。","pinyin":