n":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-10","sourceFront":"正式","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"何小姐是一名模特兒，也會自己設計服裝，這幾張圖裡的裙子都是她畫的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-19","sourceFront":"設計","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小元昨天剛買了一件八千元的大衣，沒想到那家服裝店今天打三折，他太吃虧了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-02","sourceFront":"吃虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了參加同事的婚禮，我打算當天穿上很有特色的中國傳統服裝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-03","sourceFront":"婚禮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"陳小姐今天穿了一件跟我相同牌子的洋裝，還好顏色不同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-21","sourceFront":"相同","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-22","sourceFront":"情侶裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-23","sourceFront":"情侶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爺爺在這棟公寓住了十年了，搬家時，用了好幾個大箱子來裝東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-14","sourceFront":"箱子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你在名牌服裝的專櫃工作，我想聽聽看你對穿著和品味的看法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-05","sourceFront":"看法","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我今天跟同學穿了樣式不同，但是顏色相同的洋裝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-06","sourceFront":"樣式","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:「快時尚」的服裝只有剛出來的頭幾個月受歡迎。 B:哦？你的意思是「快時尚」的衣服很快就失去魅力了嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-04","sourceFront":"哦","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小戴才三十歲就已經是名牌服裝公司的大老闆，這麼年輕就有這樣的成就，實在不簡單。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-13","sourceFront":"成就","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了符合市場的需求，「快時尚」公司不斷地設計出最流行的服裝樣式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-19","sourceFront":"符合","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有個騙子吃完了麵，假裝忘記帶錢包，騙老闆要回家拿錢，一離開就沒回來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-06","sourceFront":"假裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林阿姨來我家推銷保險，我不好意思當面拒絕她，只好假裝有急事要出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-16","sourceFront":"當面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次亞洲文化展，除了樂器表演，還有傳統服裝試穿活動，歡迎各位來參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-01","sourceFront":"各位","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"面試時必須穿正式的服裝，跟老闆對話時，也應表現出客氣、 謙虛的態度。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-24","sourceFront":"應","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了避免兒童發生意外，家長在樓梯邊裝了安全網。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-25","sourceFront":"網","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"客人看了那件洋裝一眼就走了，應該不喜歡吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-08","sourceFront":"眼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家公司雖然要求員工得穿西裝上班，但費用全是公司負擔的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-33","sourceFront":"西裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位服裝設計師相當喜愛十八世紀時的歐洲傳統風格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-02","sourceFront":"世紀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爸爸挑選西裝時，最重視的是品質，其次才是式樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-27","sourceFront":"式樣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物時不能只看包裝，品質才是最重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-50","sourceFront":"包裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她愛好化妝、穿名牌服裝，目的是希望別人讚美她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-12","sourceFront":"讚美","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大多數的模特兒都是腿長腰細的，穿什麼服裝都好看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-42","sourceFront":"細","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"旗袍是華人最有特色的服裝之一，我想訂一套屬於我的旗袍。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-05","sourceFront":"旗袍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一般來說，參加正式活動都得好好打扮，服裝也應該講究。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-56","sourceFront":"打扮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次活動大家都化裝參加，要是你碰見我大概認不出我是誰。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-03","sourceFront":"化裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她在嬰兒車上安裝了一排不同顏色的小燈，看起來很特別。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-15","sourceFront":"安裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"化裝舞會上他打扮成一具機器人，連說話走路都模仿機器人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-11","sourceFront":"具","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"路上安裝紅綠燈，是要保障民眾的交通安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-13","sourceFront":"保障","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"設計師利用上電視的機會，展示他今年設計的服裝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-06","sourceFront":"展示","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-1-05\",\"偷\",\"偷\",\"偷\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個社區很安全，不用擔心小偷來偷東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-05","sourceFront":"偷","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他昨天去逛夜市的時候，信用卡被偷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-19","sourceFront":"信用卡","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我剛買的皮包被小偷偷了，讓我又生氣又難過。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-19","sourceFront":"難過","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我聽見樓下有奇怪的聲音，是不是有小偷啊？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-19","sourceFront":"聽見","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"金先生親眼見過警察在街上抓小偷，一個跑來跑去，一個追來追去，他覺得太刺激了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-16","sourceFront":"抓","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"五年前經驗過護照被偷的意外後，每次出國我都把護照放在上衣裡面的口袋。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-23","sourceFront":"經驗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這棟大樓有安全系統的設備，小偷進去就會自動發出警告的聲音通知警察。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-08","sourceFront":"自動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"警察抓到小偷後就把他帶到警察局，關了起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-18","sourceFront":"關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小偷：我又沒偷東西，為什麼抓我？ 警察：你先別動，只要看了商店攝影機錄下來的內容，就知道事實了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-28","sourceFront":"事實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上次我出國旅行時，護照被偷了，幸好導遊通知了當地的外交人員，很快就辦好了新護照。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-33","sourceFront":"導遊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個小偷趁著觀眾看表演的時候偷東西，結果當場就被安全人員抓了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-24","sourceFront":"當場","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他上課時偷偷出去拿了蛋糕進來，原來是要幫老師慶祝生日。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-24","sourceFront":"偷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"祕書趁老闆不在把商品計畫偷走，這事已經交給法院處理了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-31","sourceFront":"祕書","sourceBookId":4,"sourceL