d":"B4L09-2-16","sourceFront":"受到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"亞洲地區發生了戰爭，使人民生活上所受的的壓力相當大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-17","sourceFront":"受","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"工作有壓力時，應適當地分配你的工作及娛樂時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-25","sourceFront":"分配","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L11-1-13\",\"交往\",\"交往\",\"交往\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我同事下個月總算要和交往十年的女朋友結婚了，真是不容易啊！。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-13","sourceFront":"交往","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-38\",\"淋\",\"淋\",\"淋\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那家店的冰淇淋很好吃，可是有點兒貴。","pinyin":"Nà jiā diàn de bīngqílín hěn hǎochī, kěshì yǒudiǎnr guì.","english":"That store has delicious ice cream, but it is a bit expensive.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-06","sourceFront":"有（一）點（兒）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我和朋友常常一起去吃冰淇淋。","pinyin":"Wǒ hé péngyǒu chángcháng yìqǐ qù chī bīngqílín.","english":"My friends and I often go have ice cream together.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-11","sourceFront":"冰淇淋","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我知道一家很不錯的咖啡廳，那裡的冰淇淋很好吃。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhīdào yì jiā hěn búcuò de kāfēitīng, nàlǐ de bīngqílín hěn hǎochī.","english":"I know a nice café. They serve delicious ice cream.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他們有巧克力冰淇淋嗎？","pinyin":"Tāmen yǒu qiǎokèlì bīngqílín ma?","english":"Do they have chocolate ice cream?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有啊！他們有很多種冰淇淋。","pinyin":"Yǒu a! Tāmen yǒu hěn duō zhǒng bīngqílín.","english":"Oh, yeah. They have lots of kinds of ice cream.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 氵(water) fills the 林(forest) leaves → soaked: 淋(drench)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"以免\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 以(according to) and 免(spare): 以免 means lest, in order to avoid."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"以前\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"以前 means 'in the past; before'. 前(front) shows the past lies in front of you in time."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"件\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 亻(person) takes a 牛(ox) down to market → one 件(item)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"做夢\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"To 做(work) a 夢(dream): 做夢 means dream."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"凶\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"The 凵(container) holds 㐅(crossing lines) like a fierce trap → 凶(fierce)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"口袋\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 口(mouth) and 袋(bag): 口袋 means pockets."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"報紙\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"報(report) + 紙(paper) → paper that reports: newspaper."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"夕陽\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 夕(evening) and 陽(sun): 夕陽 means sunset."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"寶\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Stored safely under the 宀(roof) alongside the royal 王(king) treasury, a precious 貝(shell) coin marks 寶(treasure)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"島\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 山(mountain) rising straight out of the sea is land surrounded by water: an 島(island)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"提高\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 提(carry) and 高(tall): 提高 means raise, to lift."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"激烈\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 激(arouse) and 烈(fiery): 激烈 means intense, fierce."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"為什麼\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"為(for) + 什(what) + 麼(particle) → 'for what' = why."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"瓶\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 并(merge) of 瓦(tile) clay holds water → a tall 瓶(bottle)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"零\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 雨(rain) takes 令(command) to stop → zero drops: 零(zero)."}]}
